+# Cipher
+
+A browser-based cryptography workspace with classical X25519 agreement, hybrid X25519 + ML-KEM-768, and ML-KEM-768/1024 encapsulation. Shared secrets are verified locally and converted to non-exportable AES-256-GCM keys with HKDF-SHA-256.
+
+## Run
+
+```sh
+pnpm install
+pnpm start
+```
+
+The development server defaults to port 11222. `PORT` can override it. Use localhost or HTTPS so Web Crypto is available.
+
+```sh
+pnpm test
+pnpm build
+```
+
+Both exchange participants run in this browser as a local demonstration. This app does not implement remote participant identity verification or an authenticated transport protocol. Keys and activity are held in memory and disappear on refresh; downloaded ciphertext requires its original in-memory session to decrypt. Public-key exports do not include private key material.
